{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"FairPlay DRM"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK plays FairPlay-protected HLS through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the thin wrapper around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AVFoundation that skips the YBVR signaling and geometry stack. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline behind "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","isActive":true},{"text":" and the immersive renderers, has no DRM path at all:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing in it accepts a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig","isActive":true},{"text":", so a protected stream opened through it fails to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decrypt.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That split is not an oversight waiting to be wired up. It follows from how protected frames","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reach the screen, which is covered below, and it decides which content can carry DRM at all."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Where DRM Can Be Used","type":"heading","anchor":"Where-DRM-Can-Be-Used"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Playback path"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"How frames reach the screen","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protected content"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AVPlayerLayer","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on visionOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, on device only"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","type":"reference"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Metal, from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VisionSurfaceContext"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Metal, via Compositor Services","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponentSurfaceContext","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit ","type":"text"},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not available — no API to supply a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmConfig","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rule behind the table: FairPlay decodes into a protected path that the system can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composite but the app cannot read. Surfaces that hand the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayer"},{"type":"text","text":" to the system — an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerLayer"},{"type":"text","text":", or a RealityKit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" — therefore play protected content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fine. The YBVR geometry renderers do the opposite: they copy each decoded frame out with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AVPlayerItemVideoOutput.copyPixelBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":" and draw it onto a sphere, dome, fisheye, flat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"panel, or control-room composition. No frames are handed out for protected content, so there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is nothing to texture the geometry with."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In content terms:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DRM is possible"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for material that plays as an ordinary AVFoundation item: flat or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rectilinear video, and immersive video whose projection is described by embedded metadata"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system itself understands (APMP, spatial, and the equirectangular kinds AVFoundation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recognises), which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectPlayerImmersiveScene"},{"type":"text","text":" in the visionOS demo app projects onto a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DRM is not possible"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for anything that depends on YBVR-side rendering: custom geometry","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the signaling file, viewport-tiled streams, multi-camera control rooms, or camera","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"switching inside a single stream. Those need the pixel buffers FairPlay withholds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"DRM is not possible over RTMP."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Low-latency streams play through ","type":"text"},{"code":"LowLatencyPlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is not AVFoundation-based and has no FairPlay path, so a ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block on an RTMP","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream is reported but cannot be honoured."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Configuring-DRM","text":"Configuring DRM","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The signaling file identifies the key; the certificate and license endpoints come from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host app. Both halves are required — a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on its own does not configure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let player = DirectPlayer()","","player.drmConfig = DrmConfig(","    certificateURL: \"https:\/\/...\/fairplay.cer\",","    licenseURL: \"https:\/\/...\/AcquireLicense\",","    drmKeyManager: keyManager",")","","await player.open(url: streamURL)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/drmConfig","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" before ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/open(url:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Assigning it builds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"DrmManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"open","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" installs the platform key handler around the new item — on visionOS","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the content key session is created there — so a config assigned afterwards does not apply to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the item already loaded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the stream follows the convention of a sibling signaling file, the two steps collapse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into one call that fetches the key material and opens the stream:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["try await player.open(","    url: streamURL,","    fetchingDrmFromSignalingWith: certificateURL,","    licenseURL: licenseURL",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Providers","text":"Providers","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager\/provider","type":"reference"},{"text":" selects the license flow: ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"axinom\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"ybvr\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are recognised,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and any other value falls back to Axinom. Both currently resolve to the Axinom provider,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which mints a license JWT and sends it as ","type":"text"},{"code":"X-AxDRM-Message","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the SPC.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That JWT is minted by ","type":"text"},{"code":"DrmJWTRequest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" against a hardcoded development XMS","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"backend, using OAuth client credentials compiled into the SDK. DRM therefore only works","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"today against that one environment, and the credentials ship inside any binary that links","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the SDK. Treat production DRM as needing this made configurable first.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"level":2,"text":"How DRM Is Detected","type":"heading","anchor":"How-DRM-Is-Detected"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Detection runs entirely off the signaling file, before playback starts. Nothing inspects the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"media playlist, so an encrypted stream whose signaling omits ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"text":" is indistinguishable from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"clear content until AVFoundation asks for a key and fails.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/fetchSignalingFile(video:)"},{"type":"text","text":" resolves the signaling version from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"video URL: a path containing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_signaling_v4.json"},{"type":"text","text":" is v4, any other "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"type":"text","text":" path is v3, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a media URL is v2 — where the signaling file is the same URL with its extension swapped"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for ","type":"text"},{"code":".json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The response is decoded into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Signaling"},{"type":"text","text":" (v2), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV3"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SignalingV4"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller asks the result for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". A non-","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DrmKeyManager","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" means the content is protected, and both demo apps route it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on that basis."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Content with no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" key — or with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"drm\": null"},{"type":"text","text":" — is simply unprotected. The signaling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decodes normally, no DRM is reported, and the stream plays through the usual geometry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline; this is the ordinary case for every clear title."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding the block requires all three of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ekid"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyManagerUrl"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"drmProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A block"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that is present but missing any of them is dropped on every signaling version, leaving the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"stream playable but reported as clear — so genuinely protected content then fails later at key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time with an opaque AVFoundation error rather than a DRM-specific one. Validate the block when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publishing. v4 logs the dropped block; v2 and v3 discard it silently."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What each version reports today:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signaling version"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drm"},{"type":"text","text":" in the file"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reported by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"drmKeyManager()"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v2"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"v3"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoded"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key manager"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"v4","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decoded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key manager","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A signaling model that decodes ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" but does not implement","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SignalingInterface\/drmKeyManager()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" inherits the protocol’s default of "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"silently reports protected content as clear — nothing fails to compile. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SignalingV4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" did","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly that until its accessor was added, so DRM-protected v4 streams were routed to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geometry pipeline where they cannot decrypt. Any new signaling version must implement that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"requirement, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SignalingDrmTests","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" asserts detection through the protocol rather than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concrete type to keep the path covered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Outside the manager, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/DirectPlayer\/fetchDrmKeyManager(forStreamURL:session:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" performs the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"same lookup standalone: it swaps the stream URL’s extension for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".json"},{"type":"text","text":", decodes the v2 shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectPlayerDrmError.noDrmInfoInSignaling"},{"type":"text","text":" when no "},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry is present.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-Differences","level":2,"text":"Platform Differences"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK ships for iOS 17+ and visionOS 26+, and each uses the key-delivery API available to it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Both share the same certificate fetch, license exchange, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" uses the classic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"skd:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" resource-loader flow. "},{"code":"ApplePlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sets itself as the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asset’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVAssetResourceLoaderDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for every stream, protected or not, and forwards","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key requests to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DrmManager"},{"text":" only when a config was supplied. Without one the request goes","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unanswered and playback fails."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS","type":"text"}]},{"text":" has never supported that flow and uses","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"AVContentKeySession(keySystem: .fairPlayStreaming)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with an "},{"code":"AVContentKeySessionDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The session is built during ","type":"text"},{"code":"open","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only when a config is present.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"FairPlay needs the Secure Enclave, so it does not work in the visionOS simulator —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constructing the content key session there raises an uncatchable exception. The SDK detects"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the simulator, skips the session, and logs instead of trapping, which means protected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content will load but not decrypt. Verify DRM on a real Vision Pro."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"anchor":"Failure-Modes","text":"Failure Modes","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Symptom","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Protected stream plays black, or stalls at start","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Opened through ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager"},{"type":"text","text":"; the geometry pipeline has no DRM path"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Content treated as clear despite a ","type":"text"},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The block is missing ","type":"text"},{"code":"ekid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"keyManagerUrl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"drmProvider","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"License request rejected"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"JWT minting failed; the error is swallowed and an empty ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-AxDRM-Message"},{"text":" is sent, so the CKC fetch fails","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Works on device, fails in the visionOS simulator","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Expected — FairPlay is unavailable there","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"drm","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block is detected but never honoured"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stream is RTMP, played by "},{"code":"LowLatencyPlayer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which has no FairPlay path"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"],"title":"Related Documentation","anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/DirectPlayer":{"abstract":[{"text":"Thin public wrapper around ApplePlayer for direct HLS pla